title: 'What I am unsure of: three choices made for Jeff, each a child of the decision in the perspective note.'
pid: 2ceadb8b-888e-4dd0-abd5-99ba03a6a61a
body: |2-
  An editable folder (aliases, overridden, subscribee) the new node
  would leave empty is not redrawn; a write-protected root, such as a
  search hit, is not extended and gets no default folders; the ID
  folder is not redrawn. The second was the reviewer's catch: my first
  version made a switched search hit editable and drew its content.
  Fixing that opened the gap below.
